OL,3,AIndian police accused of sexual
OL,4,Aharassment against journalists at
OL,5,Aprotest
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree female journalists have accused
OL,8,Fpolice officers in India of sexual
OL,9,Fharassment during street protests in
OL,10,Fthe capital Delhi.
OL,12,FThe claims were made on Saturday after
OL,13,Fthe force detained scores of young
OL,14,Fpeople calling for the resignation of
OL,15,Fthe chief election commissioner.
OL,17,FIn a post on social media, Delhi Police
OL,18,Fsaid its New Delhi District had
OL,19,Freceived the complaint, and it had been
OL,20,Ftransferred to its crime branch for a
OL,21,F"fair and impartial" inquiry.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
